WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:30.791
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna introduced

2
00:00:30.791 --> 00:00:32.541
the supreme knowledge

3
00:00:32.541 --> 00:00:35.041
He is about to explain in detail.

4
00:00:35.041 --> 00:00:36.416
He described

5
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:39.000
how this knowledge leads the
seeker to the highest

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.708
perfection,

7
00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:44.583
by revealing the influence of prakriti’s
three gunas –

8
00:00:44.583 --> 00:00:47.625
sattva, rajas, and tamas –

9
00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:49.500
and showing how to

10
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.250
rise above them.

11
00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:56.333
Now, in this verse, Lord Krishna explains

12
00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:59.666
that the seeker who truly takes
shelter of this knowledge

13
00:00:59.666 --> 00:01:02.916
attains a divine state –

14
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:04.500
reaching such a state,

15
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.541
they become free

16
00:01:05.541 --> 00:01:08.083
from the cycle of birth and death

17
00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:11.541
and unaffected by the rise and fall

18
00:01:11.541 --> 00:01:13.458
of creation and dissolution.

19
00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:19.708
Lord Krishna says

20
00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:23.041
that when the seeker takes shelter
of this knowledge –

21
00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:25.791
idam jnanam upashritya –

22
00:01:25.791 --> 00:01:29.166
they attain sadharmy.

23
00:01:29.166 --> 00:01:31.958
Sadharmy does not mean losing one’s identity

24
00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:35.291
by merging into God.

25
00:01:35.291 --> 00:01:39.208
Its meaning is – becoming free from
material bondage,

26
00:01:39.208 --> 00:01:42.333
finding one’s eternal spiritual identity,

27
00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:47.041
and permanently engaging in the Lord’s service.

28
00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:49.833
This matches what was said earlier in the Gita –

29
00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:55.083
mamaivamsho jivaloke – meaning

30
00:01:55.083 --> 00:01:56.083
that jivatmas

31
00:01:56.083 --> 00:01:58.333
are the Lord’s eternal portions,

32
00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.333
and their true nature

33
00:02:00.333 --> 00:02:01.833
is fulfilled in the Lord’s

34
00:02:01.833 --> 00:02:04.416
loving service.

35
00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:07.083
Even after liberation, the soul’s individual

36
00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:09.000
identity remains.

37
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.916
It continues in the Lord’s

38
00:02:10.916 --> 00:02:15.125
loving service in the spiritual realm.

39
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:18.875
Sarge’pi nopajayante means

40
00:02:18.875 --> 00:02:20.500
that such a liberated soul

41
00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:23.916
does not take rebirth at the time of creation.

42
00:02:23.916 --> 00:02:27.625
Pralaye na vyathanti ca means

43
00:02:27.625 --> 00:02:29.000
that even at the time of dissolution,

44
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.000
it is not disturbed or affected.

45
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.833
The seeker who has risen above
all three gunas –

46
00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:38.541
sattva, rajas, and tamas –

47
00:02:38.541 --> 00:02:41.458
remains situated in the eternal spiritual realm,

48
00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:45.458
beyond the cycle of creation and dissolution.

49
00:02:45.458 --> 00:02:48.291
Lord Krishna thus explains

50
00:02:48.291 --> 00:02:51.500
that this knowledge is not merely a
 subject for thought –

51
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:55.208
it is a force that transforms life.

52
00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:57.833
Those who sincerely embrace it

53
00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:01.000
are not only freed from material bondage,

54
00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:05.666
but also attain eternal companionship
with the Lord.

55
00:03:10.458 --> 00:03:11.875
In today’s world,

56
00:03:11.875 --> 00:03:13.958
you are often

57
00:03:13.958 --> 00:03:15.166
in a hurry to find

58
00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:17.750
instant solutions.

59
00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:21.000
If a suggestion does not solve the problem

60
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.666
in five minutes, you move on.

61
00:03:24.666 --> 00:03:28.208
If advice does not bring immediate ease,

62
00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:32.458
you say – ‘this is not useful.’

63
00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:35.333
But true knowledge –

64
00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:38.875
especially spiritual knowledge –

65
00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:41.208
works differently.

66
00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:45.875
It does not only smooth the surface.

67
00:03:45.875 --> 00:03:49.708
It goes to the root and brings real change.

68
00:03:49.708 --> 00:03:53.708
This is exactly the knowledge the Gita offers.

69
00:03:53.708 --> 00:03:55.333
It is not only for making

70
00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:59.375
your present situation better.

71
00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:02.833
It is for freeing you from the real

72
00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:05.666
problem – the endless

73
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:09.458
cycle of birth and death.

74
00:04:09.458 --> 00:04:12.833
The Gita does not only say this knowledge

75
00:04:12.833 --> 00:04:17.583
will make you calmer or more capable.

76
00:04:17.583 --> 00:04:22.500
It says this knowledge will take you beyond
fear, confusion,

77
00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.375
and suffering –

78
00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:27.916
to a state

79
00:04:27.916 --> 00:04:31.875
where your identity connects with your true,

80
00:04:31.875 --> 00:04:35.333
spiritual nature.

81
00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:38.708
It is easy to get caught up in today’s worries –

82
00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:42.375
financial difficulties, work challenges,

83
00:04:42.375 --> 00:04:45.458
health concerns.

84
00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:49.041
But these are only chapters,

85
00:04:49.041 --> 00:04:51.000
not the whole book.

86
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:56.166
If you keep looking for solutions only
within this chapter,

87
00:04:56.166 --> 00:04:59.583
you will lose the purpose of the entire book.

88
00:04:59.583 --> 00:05:04.458
The Gita shows you the complete picture.

89
00:05:04.458 --> 00:05:08.208
So keep the longer view.

90
00:05:08.208 --> 00:05:10.333
Embrace this knowledge,

91
00:05:10.333 --> 00:05:13.916
reflect on it, and begin walking

92
00:05:13.916 --> 00:05:19.208
the path that leads not just to a better day,

93
00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:23.458
but to the highest goal.

94
00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:26.625
Understand this well –

95
00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:29.750
choose not the solution that comes quickly,

96
00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:34.541
but the solution that lasts,

97
00:05:34.541 --> 00:05:38.250
even if it takes a little more time.

98
00:05:42.875 --> 00:05:44.125
Sometimes when you

99
00:05:44.125 --> 00:05:45.750
go to a doctor,

100
00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:49.666
you focus only on the immediate pain –

101
00:05:49.666 --> 00:05:53.416
‘Just give me something for this headache.’

102
00:05:53.416 --> 00:05:56.375
But the doctor may think –

103
00:05:56.375 --> 00:05:57.750
‘This is not the real problem.

104
00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.541
Let us also check your lifestyle, your sleep,

105
00:06:00.541 --> 00:06:05.250
and perhaps your blood sugar.’

106
00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:09.166
When you want quick relief, this approach

107
00:06:09.166 --> 00:06:11.041
may feel inconvenient.

108
00:06:11.041 --> 00:06:13.000
But a good

109
00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:16.916
doctor does not just put a bandage
on the surface.

110
00:06:16.916 --> 00:06:18.208
They try to go to

111
00:06:18.208 --> 00:06:21.666
the root and heal from there.

112
00:06:21.666 --> 00:06:24.208
The Gita does the same.

113
00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:26.375
It is not only here to offer

114
00:06:26.375 --> 00:06:30.583
a few remedies for reducing stress or conflict.

115
00:06:30.583 --> 00:06:33.875
It shows us the root cause

116
00:06:33.875 --> 00:06:37.000
of all suffering –

117
00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:41.000
our entanglement in the cycle of birth and death,

118
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:47.416
and the forgetting of who we truly are.

119
00:06:47.416 --> 00:06:51.375
In family life too, we often think

120
00:06:51.375 --> 00:06:55.333
the problem lies in something said,
something unsaid,

121
00:06:55.333 --> 00:06:58.625
or someone’s behaviour.

122
00:06:58.625 --> 00:07:04.125
But if we lift our vision a little higher,

123
00:07:04.125 --> 00:07:08.500
we begin to see deeper causes –

124
00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:13.041
misunderstandings, attachments, expectations.

125
00:07:13.041 --> 00:07:15.625
When a family sits together

126
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:18.958
to study and reflect on the Gita,

127
00:07:18.958 --> 00:07:22.416
they do not just become calmer –

128
00:07:22.416 --> 00:07:25.208
they become wiser.

129
00:07:25.208 --> 00:07:27.291
Their attention moves to what

130
00:07:27.291 --> 00:07:29.083
truly matters.

131
00:07:29.083 --> 00:07:30.375
So do not remain

132
00:07:30.375 --> 00:07:32.666
only in the business of solving

133
00:07:32.666 --> 00:07:34.416
surface problems.

134
00:07:34.416 --> 00:07:35.750
As a family,

135
00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:39.500
make the effort to rise together.

136
00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:43.666
Let everyone be drenched together
in this rain of knowledge –

137
00:07:43.666 --> 00:07:46.291
let everyone be purified together.

138
00:07:51.041 --> 00:07:54.208
When I share knowledge,

139
00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:55.916
My purpose is not

140
00:07:55.916 --> 00:07:57.166
to impress you

141
00:07:57.166 --> 00:08:01.000
with what I know –

142
00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:05.500
but to lift you to a higher level of consciousness.

143
00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.000
I wish for you

144
00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:11.333
to rise above the limitations of
the material world

145
00:08:11.333 --> 00:08:14.500
and experience a life

146
00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:20.166
rooted in truth, strength, and clarity.

147
00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:21.208
I guided

148
00:08:21.208 --> 00:08:25.250
Arjun the same way –

149
00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:29.333
not only to help him understand
the situation before him,

150
00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:32.250
but to give him the vision

151
00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:35.708
to see beyond it.

152
00:08:35.708 --> 00:08:36.916
If you are

153
00:08:36.916 --> 00:08:40.708
a junior or mid-level employee,

154
00:08:40.708 --> 00:08:44.500
receive with an open heart the
knowledge that comes to you

155
00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.125
through training, personality

156
00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:48.791
development, and capacity-building

157
00:08:48.791 --> 00:08:51.666
sessions from seniors.

158
00:08:51.666 --> 00:08:56.625
Avoiding these will stall not only your skills,

159
00:08:56.625 --> 00:09:00.666
but your personal growth too.

160
00:09:00.666 --> 00:09:03.000
Always remember –

161
00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:06.000
still water stagnates,

162
00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:10.250
while a flowing river stays pure

163
00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.416
and fresh.

164
00:09:13.416 --> 00:09:15.708
Let yourself flow

165
00:09:15.708 --> 00:09:20.083
in the river of growth and knowledge.

166
00:09:20.083 --> 00:09:23.041
If you are in a position of leadership

167
00:09:23.041 --> 00:09:24.583
at the workplace,

168
00:09:24.583 --> 00:09:28.291
share your knowledge with the intention

169
00:09:28.291 --> 00:09:31.625
to lift others up.

170
00:09:31.625 --> 00:09:35.625
Teach – not to rule,

171
00:09:35.625 --> 00:09:39.833
but to advance.

172
00:09:39.833 --> 00:09:43.041
See the members of your team

173
00:09:43.041 --> 00:09:44.291
not only as those

174
00:09:44.291 --> 00:09:46.875
who do the work, but as people

175
00:09:46.875 --> 00:09:49.000
full of potential.

176
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:53.250
Help them reach the level where they can work

177
00:09:53.250 --> 00:10:00.000
with confidence and self-awareness.

178
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.250
This is true leadership –

179
00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:06.125
when you become the reason for clarity,

180
00:10:06.125 --> 00:10:09.958
courage, and direction in someone’s life.

181
00:10:09.958 --> 00:10:13.291
When you lift others up,

182
00:10:13.291 --> 00:10:17.250
you come even closer to Me –

183
00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:22.250
because this is exactly what I do too.
